# Substrings that must not appear in a generated device name (case insensitive).
# flipper-name.sh rerolls the name when one matches.
#
# Generated names are consonant/vowel alternating (CVCVCVCVC), drawn from consonants
# "bcdfghjklmnprstvwz" and vowels "aeiou". Only alternating strings are reachable,
# so consonant clusters ("shit", "fuck") and anything with q, x or y cannot occur.
# Entries below are the reachable ones.
#
# Keep entries lowercase. They match anywhere inside the 9-letter name, so short
# entries burn name space: a 3-letter entry costs ~0.25%, a 4-letter one ~0.04%.
# The list below blocks 1.3% of the space in total. Do not paste in a
# general-purpose profanity list.
#
# Blank lines and everything after a # are ignored.

